      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Что, обиделся? Иди, иди.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "lyosha",
      "t": "Вот. Я не жадина.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "arkady",
      "t": "Вижу, вижу, ты герой. Молодец.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "So Lyosha gives up half a year of savings to prove he isn't greedy, and Arkady has his five hundred roubles. You followed a whole bargain in Russian; well done. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "lyosha",
      "t": "Пока!",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
